          "es": "Adentro esperaban tres jueces. Cuando estaban vivos, habían sido reyes sabios.",
          "en": "Inside, three judges were waiting. When they were alive, they had been wise kings."
        },
        {
          "es": "El más famoso era Minos, que había sido rey de Creta. Cada sombra se presentaba ante ellos, sola.",
          "en": "The most famous was Minos, once the king of Crete. Each shade stood before them, alone."
        },
        {
          "es": "La mayoría iba a los Campos de Asfódelos, un prado gris de flores pálidas, donde nunca pasa nada.",
          "en": "Most shades went to the Fields of Asphodel, a gray meadow of pale flowers, where nothing ever happens."
        }
      ],
