      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los héroes y las almas buenas iban al Elíseo, una tierra sin nieve ni tormentas, solo con brisas suaves.",
          "en": "Heroes and good souls went to Elysium, a land with no snow and no storms, only soft winds."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y los peores caían al Tártaro, un abismo tan hondo bajo la tierra como alto está el cielo.",
          "en": "And the very worst fell into Tartarus, a pit as deep below the earth as the sky is above it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y tú, si los jueces te miraran esta noche, ¿adónde crees que te mandarían?",
          "en": "So, if the judges looked at you tonight, where do you think they would send you?"
