      "fondo": "cueva",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 500,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.06
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero Hades puso una regla. Orfeo debía ir adelante, y no podía mirar atrás hasta salir.",
          "en": "But Hades gave one rule. Orpheus must walk in front, and he must not look back until they were outside."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así empezó la larga subida. El camino era empinado, oscuro y lleno de niebla.",
          "en": "So they began the long climb. The path was steep and dark, and full of fog."
        },
        {
          "es": "Orfeo no oía sus pasos. ¿De verdad estaba ahí? ¿Y si todo era un engaño?",
          "en": "Orpheus could not hear her steps. Was she really there? Was it all a trick?"
        },
        {
          "es": "Cerca de la salida, con la luz casi delante, miró hacia atrás.",
          "en": "Near the top, with the light almost in front of him, he turned around."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eurídice se deslizó de nuevo hacia la oscuridad. Solo dijo una palabra: adiós.",
          "en": "Eurydice slipped back into the dark. She said only one word: farewell."
        }
      ],
